-- חוזר לבעלויות תשע"ה/2 — תוכנית היבחנות חדשה בבחינות הבגרות בחטיבה העליונה (11.3.2015)
-- The matriculation preparation allowance under the new examination
-- programme (from תשע"ה): the split between the external examination and
-- the school assessment (generally 70%-30%), the year each part is paid in,
-- the definitions, the share by class size, and the subject-by-subject
-- table of the allowance before and after the reform.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `חוזר לבעלויות תשע"ה/2 — גמול הבגרות בתוכנית ההיבחנות החדשה`

-- akn:preamble The letterhead, date (11.3.2015), reference, number, addressee, greeting and subject line; no rule.

DECLARE `allowance cell` HAS
    `cell weekly hours` IS A NUMBER @desc the allowance in weekly hours (ש"ש)
    `cell percent`      IS A NUMBER @desc the allowance as a percentage; 0 where the table prints none

DECLARE `exam action` IS ONE OF
    `pay the external part` HAS `external part paid` IS A `allowance cell`
    `pay the school part`   HAS `school part paid` IS A `allowance cell`

§§ `מבוא: התוכנית החדשה`

-- ¶13: from תשע"ה the new examination programme applies in the upper
-- division. ¶14: every external examination in a subject has a school
-- assessment beside it, except mathematics at 4 and 5 units (and ¶45 of
-- the table: there it is external only, as before the reform).
DECLARE `subject` IS ONE OF
    `mathematics`
    `English`
    `Bible, state schools`
    `Bible, religious schools`
    `Oral Law, religious schools`
    `Judaism, Haredi schools`
    `Druze, Islamic or Christian culture and heritage`
    `history`
    `civics`
    `literature`
    `literature, religious schools`
    `Jewish thought, religious schools`
    `Hebrew language and expression`
    `Arabic language and literature`
    `Hebrew language and literature, non-Jewish sector`
    `biology`
    `life sciences and agriculture`
    `environmental sciences`
    `geography`
    `Land of Israel studies`
    `another elective subject`

@ref akn:preamble/p13 akn:preamble/p14 akn:art_2__para_b/p45
GIVEN s IS A `subject`, `units` IS A NUMBER, `school year` IS A NUMBER @desc the year, as the year its September falls in (תשע"ה = 2014)
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the examination has a school assessment` s `units` `school year` IF
    `school year` AT LEAST 2014
    AND NOT (s EQUALS `mathematics` AND `units` AT LEAST 4)

§§ `1. חלוקת הגמול 70%-30%`

-- 1 ¶1: as a rule, in most subjects the external and school parts are
-- 70% and 30%, as in DG circular תשע"ד/7(ד) (¶2-¶3: its address). ¶4: the
-- preparation allowance is divided the same way: where the external
-- examination and the school assessment fall in different years, 70% of the
-- allowance (in hours and in percent) is paid in the year of the external
-- examination and 30% in the year of the school assessment.
`the external share` MEANS 70%
`the school share`   MEANS 30%

DECLARE `exam part` IS ONE OF
    `the external examination`
    `the school assessment`

@ref akn:art_1 akn:art_1/p4
GIVEN full IS AN `allowance cell`, p IS AN `exam part`
GIVETH AN `allowance cell`
DECIDE `the part of the allowance` full p IS
    CONSIDER p
    WHEN `the external examination` THEN
        `allowance cell` WITH
            `cell weekly hours` IS full's `cell weekly hours` TIMES `the external share`
            `cell percent`      IS full's `cell percent` TIMES `the external share`
    WHEN `the school assessment` THEN
        `allowance cell` WITH
            `cell weekly hours` IS full's `cell weekly hours` TIMES `the school share`
            `cell percent`      IS full's `cell percent` TIMES `the school share`

-- akn:art_1/p2 akn:art_1/p3 The web address of the circular named in 1 ¶1, broken over two lines; no rule.

-- 1 ¶5 and the table's last note (¶99): where a subject already had an
-- alternative assessment before the reform, that assessment, its weight
-- and the teachers' tasks stay, and the allowance divides by that
-- subject's own split (Chinese, German, the Arab world and Islam, social
-- sciences, for example) — an input.
@ref akn:art_1/p5 akn:art_2__para_b/p99
GIVEN full IS AN `allowance cell`
      `the subject's external share` IS A NUMBER @desc the external examination's weight in a subject whose split differs from 70%-30% (an input)
GIVETH AN `allowance cell`
DECIDE `the external part by the subject's own split` full `the subject's external share` IS
    `allowance cell` WITH
        `cell weekly hours` IS full's `cell weekly hours` TIMES `the subject's external share`
        `cell percent`      IS full's `cell percent` TIMES `the subject's external share`

§§ `2. רקע, הגדרות והוראות כלליות`

-- akn:art_2 Background: the agreement of 15.7.2014 (circular תשע"ד/9) anchored the meaningful-learning reform and the preparation-allowance rules of section 1; no rule beyond section 1.
-- akn:art_2/p2 States the circular's purpose (to help apply the split); no rule.
-- akn:art_2/p3 Says the table of the allowance by subject is attached; the table is encoded below.
-- akn:art_2/p4 The heading "הגדרות"; no rule.
-- akn:art_2/p9 The heading "הוראות כלליות"; no rule.

-- ¶5-¶8, the definitions: the external examination (the State's, about
-- 70% of the material); the school matriculation (only in a subject that
-- also has an external examination; about 30%); the final grade weighs
-- the two (¶7); and the internal assessment — a grade in a subject with no
-- external examination — which does NOT entitle the teacher to the
-- preparation allowance.
DECLARE `assessment` IS ONE OF
    `an external matriculation examination`
    `a school matriculation assessment`
    `an internal assessment`

@ref akn:art_2/p5 akn:art_2/p6 akn:art_2/p7 akn:art_2/p8
GIVEN a IS AN `assessment`, `the subject has an external examination` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the assessment earns a preparation allowance` a `the subject has an external examination` IF
    CONSIDER a
    WHEN `an external matriculation examination` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `a school matriculation assessment`     THEN `the subject has an external examination`
    WHEN `an internal assessment`                THEN FALSE

-- 2(א): the external part's allowance is given in the year the class sits
-- the external examination, the school part's in the year it sits the
-- school assessment. Time in school months from the start of that year.
@ref akn:art_2__para_a
GIVEN full IS AN `allowance cell`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `exam action`
DECIDE `the external part paid in its year` full IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the external part` c
          PROVIDED c's `cell weekly hours` AT LEAST (`the part of the allowance` full `the external examination`)'s `cell weekly hours`
    WITHIN 12
    LEST  BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "circular תשע\"ה/2, 2(א): the external part is given in the year the class sits the external examination"

GIVEN full IS AN `allowance cell`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `exam action`
DECIDE `the school part paid in its year` full IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the school part` c
          PROVIDED c's `cell weekly hours` AT LEAST (`the part of the allowance` full `the school assessment`)'s `cell weekly hours`
    WITHIN 12
    LEST  BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "circular תשע\"ה/2, 2(א): the school part is given in the year the class sits the school assessment"

-- 2(ב): the table's amount is the full allowance for a class of 10 pupils
-- or more; 1-5 pupils, 25% of it; ¶2: 6-9 pupils, 50%.
@ref akn:art_2__para_b akn:art_2__para_b/p2
GIVEN `pupils` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the share for the class size` `pupils` IS
    BRANCH IF `pupils` AT LEAST 10 THEN 1
           IF `pupils` AT LEAST 6  THEN 50%
           IF `pupils` AT LEAST 1  THEN 25%
           OTHERWISE 0

-- akn:art_2__para_b/p3 akn:art_2__para_b/p4 akn:art_2__para_b/p5 akn:art_2__para_b/p6 The contact line, the greeting and the signature (Sonia Peretz), which the corpus prints inside 2(ב); no rule.
-- akn:art_2__para_b/p7 akn:art_2__para_b/p8 akn:art_2__para_b/p9 akn:art_2__para_b/p10 akn:art_2__para_b/p11 akn:art_2__para_b/p12 akn:art_2__para_b/p13 akn:art_2__para_b/p14 akn:art_2__para_b/p15 The list of copies; no rule.
-- akn:art_2__para_b/p16 akn:art_2__para_b/p17 akn:art_2__para_b/p18 akn:art_2__para_b/p19 akn:art_2__para_b/p20 akn:art_2__para_b/p21 akn:art_2__para_b/p22 akn:art_2__para_b/p23 akn:art_2__para_b/p24 The list of copies, continued; no rule.
-- akn:art_2__para_b/p25 akn:art_2__para_b/p26 akn:art_2__para_b/p27 akn:art_2__para_b/p28 akn:art_2__para_b/p29 akn:art_2__para_b/p30 The list of copies, ended; no rule.

§§ `הטבלה: גמול הבגרות לפי מקצוע`

-- The attached table, as the corpus gives it: the headers and most rows
-- as lines of text with the columns in reverse order (¶31-¶98), and one
-- page as a table (t1). Each printed row is a record, in the printed
-- order. Columns, right to left: subject, units, the pre-reform allowance
-- (hours, percent), the reform's external part (70%) and its school part
-- (30%), and a note. Where a row prints ONE reform cell, its note says
-- which part it is (the school assessment "in place of" a questionnaire),
-- and the biotope, ecotope, geotope and civics-task rows are the school
-- part as before the reform.
DECLARE `table row` HAS
    `row subject`   IS A `subject`
    `row units`     IS A NUMBER
    `row component` IS A STRING @desc the questionnaire or task, where the row prints one
    `pre-reform`    IS AN `allowance cell`
    `external part` IS A MAYBE `allowance cell`
    `school part`   IS A MAYBE `allowance cell`

GIVEN h IS A NUMBER, p IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN `allowance cell`
DECIDE `cell` h p IS
    `allowance cell` WITH
        `cell weekly hours` IS h
        `cell percent`      IS p

